```{r , results='asis' , echo=FALSE, warning=FALSE, message=FALSE}
for(loop in c(1:5)){

 print(  kable(head(iris[c("Sepal.Length", "Sepal.Width")])))

  cat("<br>x<br>")
  }
```

where you have to explicitly print the kable(...).

